  "canon:title": "Seizures induced by combined levomepromazine-fluvoxamine treatment.",
  "canon:abstract": "We report a case of combined levomepromazine-fluvoxamine treatment-induced seizures. It seems that combined treatment of fluvoxamine with phenothiazines may possess proconvulsive activity.",
  "canon:text": "Seizures induced by combined levomepromazine-fluvoxamine treatment. We report a case of combined levomepromazine-fluvoxamine treatment-induced seizures. It seems that combined treatment of fluvoxamine with phenothiazines may possess proconvulsive activity.",
